  % Soheil: the abstract read as a compressed introduction -- four scene-setting
  % sentences before the paper itself appeared, then an artifact result (beat H200) as the
  % payload. Rewritten to lead with the stake, name the instrument, and give the two-sided
  % answer. Also fixes the mixed comparator: the old "1.3\% and 3x" came from two different
